{#
compose/_scheduled.stream.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Answer to POST /compose/schedule: the window closes, a toast names the time,
and the toast's action cancels the hold.

The cancel goes to the ordinary undo route, which is the same mechanism the
ten-second send guard uses — `cancelled = true` for SendMessageHandler, plus
clearing submissionSendAt — and which reopens the draft in the composer. That
is why the toast is given eight seconds rather than four: it is not a receipt,
it is the last cheap way back out.

The window is taken down differently depending on where it was, because the
three places put it in three different containers:

  • the dock — its own frame, emptied;
  • the reply box at the foot of a thread — the frame lives inside
    #reply_zone_{id}, so the zone is re-rendered whole and comes back as the
    Reply / Reply all / Forward buttons;
  • a draft being edited in place — the frame IS the draft's row, so it is
    replaced by the row again. Still a draft: a scheduled message has not been
    sent, and its row belongs where it was.

Variables: message, ctx, sendAt (DateTimeImmutable, UTC), thread, cancelUrl
#}
{# The zone is named rather than left to default, and that is not belt and
   braces. `|date` picks it up from the Twig environment (TwigTimezoneSubscriber
   puts the user's there), but `|intl_date` keeps whatever zone the value
   already carries — and sendAt is UTC, straight off the resolver. Left implicit
   the two halves of one timestamp would disagree, and near midnight they would
   disagree about the day. #}
{% set when = ('compose.schedule.when'|trans({
    '%date%': sendAt|intl_date('dMMM', clock.timezone),
    '%time%': sendAt|date(clock.time, clock.timezone),
})) %}

<turbo-stream action="append" target="toast-region">
    <template>
        {% include '_partials/_toast.html.twig' with {
            type: 'success',
            message: 'compose.schedule.toast'|trans({ '%when%': when }),
            extra: {
                undo_url: cancelUrl,
                hide_after: 8000,
            },
        } only %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>

{% if ctx.inline and ctx.frame starts with 'compose_draft_' %}
    <turbo-stream action="replace" target="{{ ctx.frame }}">
        <template>
            {% include 'mail/_thread_message.html.twig' with {
                message:  message,
                expanded: false,
            } only %}
        </template>
    </turbo-stream>
{% elseif ctx.inline and thread is not null %}
    <turbo-stream action="replace" target="reply_zone_{{ thread.id }}">
        <template>
            {% include 'mail/_reply_zone.html.twig' with { thread: thread } only %}
        </template>
    </turbo-stream>
{% else %}
    <turbo-stream action="update" target="compose_dock">
        <template></template>
    </turbo-stream>
{% endif %}
